    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.webm?t=1725109093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.mp4?t=1725109093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>Use your highly mod-able ship to progress through classic shmup inspired horizontal stages collecting power-ups and obliterating enemies. Battle through the normal mode, or ramp up the difficulty and challenge yourself with boss battles in this retro shooter where customization is king!<br><br>The fourth game of the <strong>Game Buddy</strong> series, this game faithfully recreates the look, sounds, and feel of classic late 80's handheld games in a way that's like experiencing an alternate timeline of gaming history.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Dodge enemies and destroy them with 3 variable weapons and other power-ups. Gradually enhance your ship's firepower and change its shot types to match each situation for maximum combat efficiency! Combine different weapons to each of your add-on orbs to find unique new fun fighting styles that fit your play-style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/b87ca6407c879af336750b112740be98.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/b87ca6407c879af336750b112740be98.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Speed</strong><br>Grab this to speed up, or slowdown the movement of your ship. Each situation may benefit from fast or slow speeds, so strategic choice can be the key to victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/4e13632779f38f322157883c64f7fc91.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/4e13632779f38f322157883c64f7fc91.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Missiles</strong><br>Shoot falling bombs at level 1, two diagonal missile streams at level 2, or homing missiles at level 3!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/ff7efc120378a37a62fe574f6b4d78bc.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/ff7efc120378a37a62fe574f6b4d78bc.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Laser</strong><br>Precise high damage laser at level 1, helix blast at level 2, and powerful forward shock-wave at level 3!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/fc0c4898a5a5c9266a51f54aa301c96f.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/fc0c4898a5a5c9266a51f54aa301c96f.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Barrier</strong><br>Cover your ship/add-ons in a protective shield that temporarily protects you from damage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/3828cb904123e296458e4b12f262b628.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/3828cb904123e296458e4b12f262b628.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Vulcan Shot</strong><br>Pick this to change the firing angle of your starting shot. Can even shoot straight up and down!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Authentic feeling handheld game style horizontal shmup game-play with a fun variable item system.<br></li><li>3 game modes including normal, practice and boss battle mode.<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty levels<br></li><li>8-bit sprites and sounds that faithfully emulates the early era of handheld gaming.<br></li><li>A variety of action enhancing and nostalgic chiptune music.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to access the menu</h2><strong>To access the game menu and manual, press select button on gamepad or shift key on keyboard.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.webm?t=1725109093\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/0f45dc1362ddc5f64fd5e4be4d8d0850.mp4?t=1725109093\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2>Use your highly mod-able ship to progress through classic shmup inspired horizontal stages collecting power-ups and obliterating enemies. Battle through the normal mode, or ramp up the difficulty and challenge yourself with boss battles in this retro shooter where customization is king!<br><br>The fourth game of the <strong>Game Buddy</strong> series, this game faithfully recreates the look, sounds, and feel of classic late 80's handheld games in a way that's like experiencing an alternate timeline of gaming history.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Dodge enemies and destroy them with 3 variable weapons and other power-ups. Gradually enhance your ship's firepower and change its shot types to match each situation for maximum combat efficiency! Combine different weapons to each of your add-on orbs to find unique new fun fighting styles that fit your play-style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/b87ca6407c879af336750b112740be98.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/b87ca6407c879af336750b112740be98.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Speed</strong><br>Grab this to speed up, or slowdown the movement of your ship. Each situation may benefit from fast or slow speeds, so strategic choice can be the key to victory!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/4e13632779f38f322157883c64f7fc91.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/4e13632779f38f322157883c64f7fc91.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Missiles</strong><br>Shoot falling bombs at level 1, two diagonal missile streams at level 2, or homing missiles at level 3!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/ff7efc120378a37a62fe574f6b4d78bc.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/ff7efc120378a37a62fe574f6b4d78bc.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Laser</strong><br>Precise high damage laser at level 1, helix blast at level 2, and powerful forward shock-wave at level 3!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/fc0c4898a5a5c9266a51f54aa301c96f.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/fc0c4898a5a5c9266a51f54aa301c96f.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Barrier</strong><br>Cover your ship/add-ons in a protective shield that temporarily protects you from damage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/3828cb904123e296458e4b12f262b628.poster.avif?t=1725109093\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729440/extras/3828cb904123e296458e4b12f262b628.apng?t=1725109093\" class=\"bb_img\" width=32 height=22 /></picture></span><br><strong>Vulcan Shot</strong><br>Pick this to change the firing angle of your starting shot. Can even shoot straight up and down!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Authentic feeling handheld game style horizontal shmup game-play with a fun variable item system.<br></li><li>3 game modes including normal, practice and boss battle mode.<br></li><li>Adjustable difficulty levels<br></li><li>8-bit sprites and sounds that faithfully emulates the early era of handheld gaming.<br></li><li>A variety of action enhancing and nostalgic chiptune music.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to access the menu</h2><strong>To access the game menu and manual, press select button on gamepad or shift key on keyboard.</strong>",
